SUMMARY:Pages &amp; Pours by Novel Pairings at Ram's Gate Winery
DESCRIPTION:Pages &amp; Pours is a relaxed reading night for people who want a little space to slow down\, open a book\, and enjoy a great glass of wine. Your ticket includes a guided wine tasting\, a full glass\, access to a bring-one\, take-one book swap\, and a few extra thoughtful touches to make the night feel special. Come solo or with a friend\, read as much (or as little) as you want\, and stay for easy\, optional conversation. It’s the kind of night you’ll wish you planned more often.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/pages-pours-by-novel-pairings-at-rams-gate-winery/
LOCATION:28700 Arnold Drive, Sonoma, CA, 95476, United States
GEO:-122.4516096;38.173791
