SUMMARY:Composting &amp; Worm Café at Quivira Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Discover the magic of healthy soil in this hands-on garden workshop at Quivira Vineyards. Guests will explore the benefits of composting and experience the winery’s Worm Café vermicompost system\, learning simple techniques to build a thriving garden at home.    This interactive class offers practical tips for improving soil health and sustainability\, making it perfect for beginners and garden enthusiasts alike. Participants will receive gardening gloves\, a starter set of worms\, and a plant start to continue their journey at home.  To round out the experience\, guests can relax with a complimentary glass of wine while enjoying the beauty of the estate.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/composting-worm-cafe-at-quivira-vineyards/
LOCATION:4900 West Dry Creek Road, Healdsburg, CA, 95448, United States
GEO:-122.938042;38.656225
CATEGORIES:Benefit,Educational,Outdoors,Sonoma County,Wine
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/05/02215024/worms.png
END:VEVENT
