SUMMARY:Live Music by Saritah at Usher Gallery
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy an uplifting evening of music and community during Saritah’s “Give Love Tour\,” featuring a special performance alongside Gina René in Petaluma. Known for her soulful sound and positive energy\, Saritah brings an inspiring live experience filled with rhythm\, connection\, and feel-good vibes.    Guests can enjoy refreshments\, dancing\, and the welcoming artistic atmosphere provided by Usher Gallery.    This joyful gathering celebrates music\, creativity\, and community in a warm and vibrant setting.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/live-music-by-saritah-at-usher-gallery/
LOCATION:1 Petaluma Blvd North, Petaluma, CA, 94952, United States
