SUMMARY:The Magic Banana Hour at Sebastiani Theatre
DESCRIPTION:The Magic Banana Hour comes to Sebastiani Theatre for an unforgettable evening of world-class comedy\, music\, magic\, and mayhem! This turbo-charged variety show throws it back to the golden era of vaudeville and classic TV specials\, featuring stars from Cirque du Soleil and Blue Man Group.    Get ready for big laughs\, jaw-dropping circus acts\, banana juggling\, magical puppets\, and even a surprise appearance by a California Grizzly Bear (yes\, really). Critics rave: “Inspired Comedy” – Variety and “Eye-watering Vaudeville” – Time Out London.    Perfect for a night out that’s playful\, quirky\, and wildly entertaining!
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/the-magic-banana-hour-at-sebastiani-theatre/
LOCATION:476 First Street East, Sonoma, CA, 95476, United States
GEO:-122.4564251;38.2922736
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Live Music,Music,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
